<title>POLAND: WBK MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 12.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 12.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 12.71 vs   13.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   19.92 vs   19.13</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 40.85 vs   36.70</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	81.77 vs   67.74</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 64.21 vs   65.88</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  100.27 vs   97.80</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		197.73 vs  178.08</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     383.49 vs  326.15</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
